        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Suresh Peters, S.P. Venkatesh\n- Songs: \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\", \"Style\"\n- Films: \"Gentleman\", \"Punjabi House\"\n- Roles: music director, playback rapper/singer, film composer\n\nFacts:\n- In 1993, the Tamil film \"Gentleman\" featured the Tamil song \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\".\n- Suresh Peters is a music director and playback rapper/singer for films in India.\n- Suresh Peters's notable songs include \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" from \"Gentleman\" and \"Style\".\n- For the film \"Punjabi House\", Suresh Peters composed the songs in his debut as a film composer.\n- For the film \"Punjabi House\", S.P. Venkatesh composed the score.",
